           SRI .----------------UTAH
               | .
               |   .
               |     .
               |       .
               |         .
               |           .
               |             .
               |               .
           UCLA-----------------UCSB


   8b  Selected group of previous test

       8b1  All of 6

       8b2  7b

   8c  Expand voice coordination scheme

       8c1  UTAH has access to UCLA and UCSB via SRI

       8c2  with BBN and ARPA

